From: Radeon24 <Radeon24@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: MAINTAINERS: add Fortinet, the Faraday FA626TE/FA726TE and the FortiSOC entries

Add the Fortinet vendor prefix, the Faraday FA626TE and FA726TE CPU
compatibles, and the MAINTAINERS entries of the FortiSOC platforms,
bindings and drivers.
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Radeon24 <Radeon24@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/cpus.yaml    |  3 +
 ...tation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml |  2 +
 MAINTAINERS                                        | 33 +++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 38 insertions(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/cpus.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/cpus.yaml
@@ -188,6 +188,8 @@ properties:
       - cavium,thunder
       - cavium,thunder2
       - faraday,fa526
+      - faraday,fa626te
+      - faraday,fa726te
       - intel,sa110
       - intel,sa1100
       - marvell,feroceon
@@ -247,6 +249,7 @@ properties:
           - brcm,bcm63138
           - brcm,bcm-nsp-smp
           - brcm,brahma-b15
+          - fortinet,fsoc3-smp
           - marvell,armada-375-smp
           - marvell,armada-380-smp
           - marvell,armada-390-smp
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -578,6 +578,8 @@ patternProperties:
     description: FocalTech Systems Co.,Ltd
   "^forlinx,.*":
     description: Baoding Forlinx Embedded Technology Co., Ltd.
+  "^fortinet,.*":
+    description: Fortinet, Inc.
   "^foursemi,.*":
     description: Shanghai FourSemi Semiconductor Co.,Ltd.
   "^foxlink,.*":
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -2695,6 +2695,39 @@ W:	http://www.armlinux.org.uk/
 F:	arch/arm/include/asm/hardware/dec21285.h
 F:	arch/arm/mach-footbridge/
 
+ARM/FORTINET FORTISOC SUPPORT
+M:	Radeon24 <Radeon24@users.noreply.github.com>
+L:	linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org (moderated for non-subscribers)
